{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_109_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_109","textTraditional":"一、十有三年，春王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_109_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_109","textTraditional":"二、夏五月壬午，陳侯朔卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_109_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_109","textTraditional":"三、邾婁子蘧蒢卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_109_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_109","textTraditional":"四、自正月不雨，至于秋七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_109_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_109","textTraditional":"五、世室屋壞。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_109_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_109","textTraditional":"世室者何？魯公之廟也。周公稱太廟，魯公稱世室，群公稱宮。此魯公之廟也，曷為謂之世室？世室，猶世室也，世世不毀也。周公何以稱大廟于魯？封魯公以為周公也。周公拜乎前，魯公拜乎後。曰：「生以養周公，死以為周公主。」然則周公之魯乎？曰：「不之魯也。」封魯公以為周公主，然則周公曷為不之魯？欲天下之一乎周也。魯祭周公何以為牲？周公用白牲，魯公用騂犅，群公不毛。魯祭周公何以為盛？周公盛，魯公燾，群公廩。世室屋壞，何以書？譏。何譏爾？久不修也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_109_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_109","textTraditional":"六、冬，公如晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_109_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_109","textTraditional":"七、衞侯會于沓。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_109_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_109","textTraditional":"八、狄侵衞。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_109_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_109","textTraditional":"九、十有二月己丑，公及晉侯盟。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_109_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_109","textTraditional":"十、還自晉。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_109_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_109","textTraditional":"十一、鄭伯會公于棐。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_109_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_109","textTraditional":"還者何？善辭也。何善爾？往黨衞侯會公于沓，至得與晉侯盟。反黨鄭伯會公于斐，故善之也。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}